</tr>
<tr>
<td>publicIPAllocationMethod</td>
<td>The public IP address allocation method.</td>
<td>'Dynamic'<br>'Static'</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>publicIPPrefix</td>
<td>The Public IP Prefix this Public IP Address should be allocated from.</td>
<td><a href="#subresource-2" data-linktype="self-bookmark">SubResource</a></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>servicePublicIPAddress</td>
